<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Тонкий снег"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Chengcheng Tang"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="album" value="时间啊，向前！OST"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3456703380"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="004b6fnn3EXn1F"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="738914312"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:47.840"><div begin="0.540" end="2:47.840"><p begin="0.540" end="7.830" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.540" end="0.930">И</span> <span begin="1.100" end="1.700">не</span><span begin="1.700" end="1.750">т</span> <span begin="2.220" end="2.620">ни</span><span begin="2.710" end="3.170">че</span><span begin="3.280" end="3.710">го</span> <span begin="4.180" end="4.270">к</span><span begin="4.270" end="4.690">ро</span><span begin="4.770" end="5.180">ме</span> <span begin="5.350" end="7.250">не</span><span begin="7.400" end="7.830">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了天空 便再无他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">除了天空 便再無他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And there is nothing but the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空のほかには何もない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘 외에는 아무것도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il n&apos;y a rien d&apos;autre que le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y no hay nada más que el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und da ist nichts außer dem Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E não há nada além do céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E non c&apos;è nient&apos;altro che il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I net nichego krome neba</span></p><p begin="8.610" end="16.100" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.610" end="9.010">Вы</span><span begin="9.490" end="10.360">со</span><span begin="10.490" end="11.020">ко</span><span begin="11.020" end="11.400">го</span> <span begin="11.520" end="12.040">ти</span><span begin="12.580" end="13.080">хо</span><span begin="13.080" end="13.470">го</span> <span begin="13.610" end="15.230">бе</span><span begin="15.230" end="15.570">ло</span><span begin="15.720" end="16.100">го</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那般高远 那般寂静 那般洁白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那般高遠 那般寂靜 那般潔白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So high so still so white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">高く 静かで 真っ白な空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">높고 고요하고 새하얀 하늘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si haut si silencieux si blanc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan alto tan silencioso tan blanco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So hoch so still so weiß</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão alto tão silencioso tão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così alto così silenzioso così bianco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Vysokogo tikhogo belogo</span></p><p begin="17.380" end="25.240" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.380" end="17.770">Пол</span><span begin="17.890" end="18.540">зу</span><span begin="18.540" end="18.580">т</span> <span begin="18.940" end="19.550">о</span><span begin="19.550" end="19.660">б</span><span begin="19.660" end="19.890">ла</span><span begin="20.030" end="20.560">ка</span> <span begin="21.020" end="21.250">бе</span><span begin="21.250" end="21.500">с</span><span begin="21.500" end="21.910">ко</span><span begin="22.040" end="23.950">не</span><span begin="23.950" end="24.100">ч</span><span begin="24.220" end="25.240">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">云层缓缓流转 仿佛永无尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雲層緩緩流轉 彷彿永無盡頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The clouds drift endlessly onward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">雲は果てしなく這うように流れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구름은 끝없이 느릿느릿 흘러가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les nuages dérivent sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las nubes se arrastran sin fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wolken ziehen endlos dahin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As nuvens se arrastam sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le nuvole scorrono lente senza fine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Polzut oblaka beskonechno</span></p><p begin="25.240" end="33.100" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.240" end="25.440">И</span> <span begin="26.280" end="27.240">Мы</span><span begin="27.240" end="27.480">с</span><span begin="27.480" end="27.710">ли</span> <span begin="27.710" end="27.950">с</span><span begin="27.950" end="28.480">та</span><span begin="28.480" end="29.230">но</span><span begin="29.230" end="29.510">вят</span><span begin="29.510" end="30.120">ся</span> <span begin="30.120" end="30.320">бе</span><span begin="30.320" end="30.600">с</span><span begin="30.600" end="31.930">пе</span><span begin="31.930" end="32.060">ч</span><span begin="32.060" end="33.100">ны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思绪也渐渐变得无忧无虑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">思緒也漸漸變得無憂無慮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And our thoughts grow carefree</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">思いもいつしか憂いを忘れてゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생각마저 점점 근심을 잊어 가네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et les pensées deviennent insouciantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y los pensamientos se vuelven despreocupados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die Gedanken werden unbeschwert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E os pensamentos se tornam despreocupados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E i pensieri si fanno spensierati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I mysli stanovyatsya bespechny</span></p><p begin="34.280" end="41.540" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.280" end="34.630">Не</span> <span begin="34.800" end="35.690">ви</span><span begin="35.790" end="36.380">де</span><span begin="36.380" end="36.870">ли</span> <span begin="36.870" end="37.380">ран</span><span begin="37.920" end="38.430">ьше</span> <span begin="38.510" end="38.890">мы</span> <span begin="39.080" end="40.920">не</span><span begin="41.090" end="41.540">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从前的我们 不曾见过这样的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從前的我們 不曾見過這樣的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We had never seen the sky before</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">かつて私たちはこんな空を知らなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전의 우리는 이런 하늘을 본 적이 없었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous n&apos;avions jamais vu un tel ciel auparavant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Antes nunca habíamos visto el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Einen solchen Himmel hatten wir früher nie gesehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Antes nunca tínhamos visto o céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prima non avevamo mai visto un cielo simile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne videli ran&apos;she my neba</span></p><p begin="42.180" end="50.000" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.180" end="42.510">Не</span> <span begin="42.980" end="43.140">з</span><span begin="43.140" end="44.190">на</span><span begin="44.190" end="44.640">ли</span> <span begin="44.730" end="45.080">мы</span> <span begin="45.080" end="45.120">г</span><span begin="45.210" end="45.660">де</span> <span begin="46.380" end="46.720">и</span><span begin="46.720" end="46.920">с</span><span begin="46.920" end="47.280">ка</span><span begin="47.280" end="47.500">ть сч</span><span begin="47.500" end="49.250">а</span><span begin="49.250" end="49.440">с</span><span begin="49.440" end="49.540">т</span><span begin="49.540" end="50.000">ья</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不知该去何处寻觅幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也不知該去何處尋覓幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We never knew where to find happiness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">幸せをどこに探せばいいのかも知らなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">행복을 어디서 찾아야 할지도 몰랐어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous ne savions pas où chercher le bonheur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sabíamos dónde buscar la felicidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir wussten nicht wo wir das Glück suchen sollten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sabíamos onde procurar a felicidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sapevamo dove cercare la felicità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne znali my gde iskat&apos; schast&apos;ya</span></p><p begin="51.130" end="58.990" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.130" end="51.500">А</span> <span begin="51.640" end="52.490">ве</span><span begin="52.590" end="53.040">тер</span> <span begin="53.190" end="53.480">тот</span> <span begin="53.680" end="54.190">дул</span> <span begin="54.730" end="55.060">та</span><span begin="55.060" end="55.110">к</span> <span begin="55.110" end="55.300">с</span><span begin="55.300" end="55.770">ви</span><span begin="55.770" end="57.680">ре</span><span begin="57.900" end="58.990">по</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而那时的风 却呼啸得如此凛冽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">而那時的風 卻呼嘯得如此凜冽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Yet the wind blew so fiercely back then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの頃の風はあまりにも激しく吹き荒れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그때 바람은 그토록 사납게 불었고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce vent soufflait avec tant de fureur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aquel viento soplaba con tanta ferocidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch jener Wind wehte so erbarmungslos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E aquele vento soprava com tanta fúria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quel vento soffiava così ferocemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">A veter tot dul tak svirepo</span></p><p begin="58.990" end="1:06.670" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.990" end="59.180">И</span> <span begin="1:00.020" end="1:00.920">ну</span><span begin="1:00.920" end="1:01.020">ж</span><span begin="1:01.100" end="1:01.650">но</span> <span begin="1:01.650" end="1:01.890">и</span><span begin="1:02.100" end="1:02.460">дти</span> <span begin="1:03.210" end="1:03.720">бы</span><span begin="1:03.720" end="1:04.040">ло</span> <span begin="1:04.200" end="1:06.200">дал</span><span begin="1:06.200" end="1:06.450">ьш</span><span begin="1:06.450" end="1:06.670">е</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍不得不继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們仍不得不繼續前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And we had no choice but to keep moving forward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも歩み続けなければならなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 계속 나아가야만 했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant il nous fallait continuer d&apos;avancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así teníamos que seguir adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und wir mussten dennoch weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E ainda precisávamos seguir em frente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E dovevamo continuare ad andare avanti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I nuzhno idti bylo dal&apos;she</span></p><p begin="1:07.920" end="1:15.460" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.920" end="1:08.170">А</span><span begin="1:08.170" end="1:08.270">х</span> <span begin="1:08.380" end="1:09.370">ка</span><span begin="1:09.370" end="1:09.460">к</span> <span begin="1:09.460" end="1:09.890">же</span> <span begin="1:10.000" end="1:10.370">то</span><span begin="1:10.370" end="1:10.410">г</span><span begin="1:10.500" end="1:10.990">да</span> <span begin="1:11.480" end="1:12.010">за</span><span begin="1:12.010" end="1:12.110">б</span><span begin="1:12.110" end="1:12.380">лу</span><span begin="1:12.380" end="1:12.590">ж</span><span begin="1:12.590" end="1:14.780">да</span><span begin="1:14.780" end="1:15.080">ли</span><span begin="1:15.350" end="1:15.460">сь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 那时的我们竟错得如此之深</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 那時的我們竟錯得如此之深</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh how mistaken we were back then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ あの頃の私たちはどれほど思い違いをしていたのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아 그때 우리는 얼마나 잘못 알고 있었던 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah comme nous nous trompions alors</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah cuánto nos equivocábamos entonces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wie sehr wir uns damals irrten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah como estávamos enganados naquela época</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah quanto ci sbagliavamo allora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Akh kak zhe togda zabluzhdalis&apos;</span></p><p begin="1:16.330" end="1:23.800" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.330" end="1:16.690">Ко</span><span begin="1:16.690" end="1:16.790">г</span><span begin="1:16.790" end="1:17.800">да</span> <span begin="1:17.880" end="1:18.440">на</span> <span begin="1:18.440" end="1:18.970">до</span><span begin="1:18.970" end="1:19.440">ро</span><span begin="1:19.970" end="1:20.370">ге</span> <span begin="1:20.470" end="1:20.520">п</span><span begin="1:20.520" end="1:20.800">ро</span><span begin="1:20.800" end="1:21.060">щ</span><span begin="1:21.060" end="1:23.190">а</span><span begin="1:23.190" end="1:23.470">ли</span><span begin="1:23.680" end="1:23.800">сь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们在漫漫长路上挥手作别</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我們在漫漫長路上揮手作別</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When we said our goodbyes along the road</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの道で別れを告げた時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길 위에서 서로 작별을 나누던 그때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Lorsque nous nous faisions nos adieux sur la route</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando nos despedíamos en el camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als wir auf dem Weg Abschied voneinander nahmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando nos despedíamos na estrada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando ci dicevamo addio lungo la strada</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kogda na doroge proshchalis&apos;</span></p><p begin="1:24.750" end="1:31.860" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.750" end="1:25.060">Не</span> <span begin="1:25.060" end="1:25.250">ж</span><span begin="1:25.250" end="1:26.310">да</span><span begin="1:26.310" end="1:26.820">ли</span> <span begin="1:26.820" end="1:27.100">мы</span> <span begin="1:27.100" end="1:27.350">с</span><span begin="1:27.350" end="1:27.890">ко</span><span begin="1:28.370" end="1:28.420">р</span><span begin="1:28.420" end="1:28.710">ы</span><span begin="1:28.710" end="1:28.800">х</span> <span begin="1:28.920" end="1:29.320">по</span><span begin="1:29.320" end="1:29.490">т</span><span begin="1:29.490" end="1:31.540">е</span><span begin="1:31.540" end="1:31.860">рь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未曾料到 失去竟会来得如此仓促</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">未曾料到 失去竟會來得如此倉促</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We never expected loss to come so soon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">間もなく訪れる喪失など思いもせずに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">곧 닥쳐올 상실을 예상하지 못했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous ne pressentions pas les pertes si proches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No esperábamos pérdidas tan próximas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir ahnten nicht dass uns bald Verluste bevorstanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não esperávamos perdas tão próximas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non ci aspettavamo perdite così imminenti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne zhdali my skorykh poter&apos;</span></p><p begin="1:33.110" end="1:40.220" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.110" end="1:33.550">Бе</span><span begin="1:33.550" end="1:33.710">ж</span><span begin="1:33.710" end="1:34.620">и</span><span begin="1:34.620" end="1:34.660">т</span> <span begin="1:34.770" end="1:35.310">по</span> <span begin="1:35.310" end="1:35.770">зе</span><span begin="1:35.770" end="1:35.870">м</span><span begin="1:35.870" end="1:36.200">ле</span> <span begin="1:36.630" end="1:36.700">к</span><span begin="1:36.700" end="1:36.970">рыл</span><span begin="1:36.970" end="1:37.370">а</span><span begin="1:37.470" end="1:37.760">тый</span> <span begin="1:37.760" end="1:37.950">з</span><span begin="1:37.950" end="1:39.950">ве</span><span begin="1:39.950" end="1:40.220">рь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生有双翼的野兽 仍在大地上奔行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生有雙翼的野獸 仍在大地上奔行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A winged beast runs across the earth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">翼を持つ獣が大地を駆けてゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날개 달린 짐승이 땅 위를 달려가네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une bête ailée court sur la terre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una bestia alada corre sobre la tierra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein geflügeltes Tier rennt über die Erde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma fera alada corre sobre a terra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sulla terra corre una bestia alata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bezhit po zemle krylatyy zver&apos;</span></p><p begin="1:58.460" end="2:05.770" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.460" end="1:58.820">И</span> <span begin="1:59.010" end="1:59.650">не</span><span begin="1:59.650" end="1:59.680">т</span> <span begin="2:00.060" end="2:00.440">ни</span><span begin="2:00.570" end="2:00.990">че</span><span begin="2:01.120" end="2:01.580">го</span> <span begin="2:02.030" end="2:02.120">к</span><span begin="2:02.120" end="2:02.640">ро</span><span begin="2:02.640" end="2:03.060">ме</span> <span begin="2:03.240" end="2:05.220">не</span><span begin="2:05.360" end="2:05.770">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了天空 便再无他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">除了天空 便再無他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And there is nothing but the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空のほかには何もない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘 외에는 아무것도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il n&apos;y a rien d&apos;autre que le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y no hay nada más que el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und da ist nichts außer dem Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E não há nada além do céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E non c&apos;è nient&apos;altro che il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I net nichego krome neba</span></p><p begin="2:06.350" end="2:14.370" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.350" end="2:06.840">Вы</span><span begin="2:07.310" end="2:08.350">со</span><span begin="2:08.440" end="2:09.000">ко</span><span begin="2:09.000" end="2:09.410">го</span> <span begin="2:09.530" end="2:10.040">ти</span><span begin="2:10.520" end="2:11.030">хо</span><span begin="2:11.030" end="2:11.470">го</span> <span begin="2:11.570" end="2:13.190">бе</span><span begin="2:13.190" end="2:13.600">ло</span><span begin="2:13.710" end="2:14.370">го</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那般高远 那般寂静 那般洁白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那般高遠 那般寂靜 那般潔白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So high so still so white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">高く 静かで 真っ白な空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">높고 고요하고 새하얀 하늘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si haut si silencieux si blanc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan alto tan silencioso tan blanco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So hoch so still so weiß</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão alto tão silencioso tão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così alto così silenzioso così bianco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Vysokogo tikhogo belogo</span></p><p begin="2:15.750" end="2:22.550" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.750" end="2:16.720">Сер</span><span begin="2:16.720" end="2:16.880">д</span><span begin="2:16.880" end="2:17.270">це</span> <span begin="2:17.380" end="2:17.430">п</span><span begin="2:17.430" end="2:17.740">рон</span><span begin="2:17.880" end="2:18.970">за</span><span begin="2:18.970" end="2:19.120">ет</span> <span begin="2:19.420" end="2:19.470">т</span><span begin="2:19.470" end="2:19.880">ре</span><span begin="2:20.000" end="2:21.930">во</span><span begin="2:22.080" end="2:22.550">га</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忧惧如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憂懼如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dread pierces the heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">不安が胸を突き刺す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안이 가슴을 꿰뚫고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;angoisse transperce mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La angustia atraviesa el corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst durchbohrt das Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A angústia trespassa o coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;angoscia trafigge il cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Serdtse pronzaet trevoga</span></p><p begin="2:24.180" end="2:30.920" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.180" end="2:24.510">Мо</span><span begin="2:24.510" end="2:24.730">е</span><span begin="2:24.730" end="2:25.240">го</span> <span begin="2:25.240" end="2:25.690">не</span> <span begin="2:25.690" end="2:25.950">о</span><span begin="2:25.950" end="2:26.240">с</span><span begin="2:26.240" end="2:27.230">та</span><span begin="2:27.310" end="2:27.510">не</span><span begin="2:27.730" end="2:28.050">тся</span> <span begin="2:28.580" end="2:30.430">до</span><span begin="2:30.570" end="2:30.920">ма</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的家终将不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的家終將不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There will be no home left for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の帰る家はもう残らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게는 더 이상 집이 남아 있지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il ne restera rien de mon foyer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no me quedará un hogar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Von meinem Zuhause wird nichts mehr übrig bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu lar já não existirá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non avrò più una casa da chiamare mia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moego ne ostanetsya doma</span></p><p begin="2:32.600" end="2:39.260" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.600" end="2:33.600">Сер</span><span begin="2:33.600" end="2:33.750">д</span><span begin="2:33.750" end="2:34.160">це</span> <span begin="2:34.270" end="2:34.320">п</span><span begin="2:34.320" end="2:34.590">рон</span><span begin="2:34.760" end="2:35.800">за</span><span begin="2:35.800" end="2:35.960">ет</span> <span begin="2:36.240" end="2:36.290">т</span><span begin="2:36.290" end="2:36.720">ре</span><span begin="2:36.840" end="2:38.790">во</span><span begin="2:38.920" end="2:39.260">га</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忧惧如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憂懼如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dread pierces the heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">不安が胸を突き刺す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안이 가슴을 꿰뚫고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;angoisse transperce mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La angustia atraviesa el corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst durchbohrt das Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A angústia trespassa o coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;angoscia trafigge il cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Serdtse pronzaet trevoga</span></p><p begin="2:41.070" end="2:47.840" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.070" end="2:41.340">Мо</span><span begin="2:41.340" end="2:41.560">е</span><span begin="2:41.560" end="2:42.100">го</span> <span begin="2:42.100" end="2:42.560">не</span> <span begin="2:42.560" end="2:42.800">о</span><span begin="2:42.800" end="2:43.100">с</span><span begin="2:43.100" end="2:44.230">та</span><span begin="2:44.230" end="2:44.460">не</span><span begin="2:44.640" end="2:44.990">тся</span> <span begin="2:45.730" end="2:47.280">до</span><span begin="2:47.420" end="2:47.840">ма</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的家终将不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的家終將不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There will be no home left for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の帰る家はもう残らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게는 더 이상 집이 남아 있지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il ne restera rien de mon foyer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no me quedará un hogar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Von meinem Zuhause wird nichts mehr übrig bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu lar já não existirá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non avrò più una casa da chiamare mia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moego ne ostanetsya doma</span></p></div></body></tt>